{"id":1143,"date":"2025-06-10T13:26:13","date_gmt":"2025-06-10T13:26:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/?p=1143"},"modified":"2025-06-10T13:26:13","modified_gmt":"2025-06-10T13:26:13","slug":"10-de-junio-dia-de-la-afirmacion-de-los-derechos-argentinos-sobre-las-malvinas-islas-y-sector-antartico","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/10-de-junio-dia-de-la-afirmacion-de-los-derechos-argentinos-sobre-las-malvinas-islas-y-sector-antartico\/","title":{"rendered":"10 de junio: D\u00eda de la Afirmaci\u00f3n de los Derechos Argentinos sobre las Malvinas, Islas y Sector Ant\u00e1rtico"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">En el marco del <strong>D\u00eda de la Afirmaci\u00f3n de los Derechos Argentinos sobre las Islas Malvinas<\/strong>, conmemorado cada 10 de junio, nuestra instituci\u00f3n se suma a la propuesta impulsada desde la Direcci\u00f3n de Educaci\u00f3n Superior.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La actividad consiste en reflexionar en torno a la soberan\u00eda nacional sobre las Islas Malvinas, y se acompa\u00f1a con un cartel simb\u00f3lico que indica la distancia entre nuestra escuela y las islas, reafirmando el v\u00ednculo geogr\u00e1fico, hist\u00f3rico y cultural que nos une a ellas.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP3.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"1145\" src=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP3-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1145\" srcset=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP3-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP3-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP3-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP3-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP3-70x70.png 70w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP3-246x246.png 246w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP3-276x276.png 276w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP3-125x125.png 125w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP3.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWPPortada.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"1144\" src=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWPPortada-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1144\" srcset=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWPPortada-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWPPortada-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWPPortada-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWPPortada-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWPPortada-70x70.png 70w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWPPortada-246x246.png 246w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWPPortada-276x276.png 276w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWPPortada-125x125.png 125w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWPPortada.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:29px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Distancia desde nuestra instituci\u00f3n a las Islas Malvinas:<\/strong> 1.821 km<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Este gesto busca visibilizar el leg\u00edtimo reclamo argentino sobre los territorios usurpados, recordando que la soberan\u00eda no es solo un derecho, sino tambi\u00e9n un deber que se cultiva con memoria, educaci\u00f3n y compromiso.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP2.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP2-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1150\" srcset=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP2-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP2-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP2-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP2-1536x864.png 1536w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/10DeJunioWP2.png 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:29px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Desde nuestra instituci\u00f3n, renovamos el compromiso con la soberan\u00eda nacional y la ense\u00f1anza de nuestra historia como herramienta de conciencia colectiva.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Las Malvinas son argentinas.<\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>En el marco del D\u00eda de la Afirmaci\u00f3n de los Derechos Argentinos sobre las Islas Malvinas, conmemorado cada 10 de &hellip; <\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":1148,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[24,25,15,23,22,26],"class_list":["post-1143","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-sin-categoria","tag-argentina","tag-derechos","tag-educacion-2","tag-islasargentinas","tag-malvinas","tag-malvinasargentinas"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1143","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1143"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1143\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1152,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1143\/revisions\/1152"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1148"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1143"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=1143"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=1143"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}